; c07-straight-off-double. Anchors: shot-0089 (Ch. 7) and shot-0101 (Ch. 8).
; Printed: 2/3 (two to one).
; Claim: bidding 84 with an off whose double he lacks, the bidder finds that
;   double with an opponent.
; State: the bidder holds trumps, doubles and one off (a non-double outside
;   trump), not its double; nothing played; the 21 others dealt uniformly,
;   seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 2/3. Book model: 2/3.
(query
  (viewer v)
  (opponent v x)
  (not (double off))
  (not (in off q*))
  (leads-context off q)
  (holds v off)
  (double d)
  (in d q)
  (holds x d))
